# KeuTrack Architecture

Android · Kotlin · Jetpack Compose · Multi-module Clean Architecture · Hilt · Firebase

## Module Structure

```
:app                → depends on :features:*, :core:designsystem, :core:common
:features:*         → depends on :core:domain, :core:designsystem, :core:common, :core:network
:core:data          → depends on :core:domain, :core:datastore, :core:network
:core:domain        → NO dependencies (pure Kotlin + javax.inject)
:core:designsystem  → depends on :core:common
:core:datastore     → standalone
:core:common        → NO dependencies
:core:network       → standalone
:build-plugin       → convention plugins, shared across all modules
```

## Dependency Rules (STRICT)

- `:features:*` MUST NOT depend on each other — communicate only via navigation or shared `:core` state
- `:core:domain` MUST NOT import Android framework classes (except `javax.inject`)
- `:core:data` implements repository interfaces defined in `:core:domain`
- Feature modules MUST NOT contain repository implementations — put them in `:core:data`
- All Firestore/Room/DataStore access goes through `:core:data`, never directly from features

## Package Convention

- Base package: `com.mascill.keutrack`
- Core: `com.mascill.keutrack.core.{module}` (e.g., `core.domain`, `core.data`)
- Feature: `com.mascill.keutrack.feature.{name}` (e.g., `feature.dashboard`, `feature.auth`)
- Build plugin: `com.mascill.keutrack.buildplugin.convention`

## Tech Stack

| Concern | Technology |
|---------|-----------|
| UI | Jetpack Compose (Material 2 — `androidx.compose.material`) |
| DI | Hilt + KSP |
| Navigation | Navigation Compose (type-safe routes with `@Serializable`) |
| Local storage | Proto DataStore (user session), Room (financial data — Phase 2+) |
| Remote | Firebase Auth, Firestore |
| Networking | Retrofit + Moshi (for non-Firebase APIs) |
| Image loading | Coil |
| Async | Kotlin Coroutines + Flow |
| Min SDK | 28 |

## Key Conventions

- Language: Kotlin only (no Java)
- All screens use `KeuTrackTheme` — never raw `MaterialTheme`
- Use `CommonDispatcher` for coroutine dispatchers (testability)
- Use `CancellationException` propagation pattern: always `catch (e: CancellationException) { throw e }` before generic catch blocks
- Financial amounts use `Long` (not Double) — IDR has no decimals
